Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:11.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.39,0:00:17.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:23.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:30.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:47.42,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:53.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:01:00.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:05.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:12.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.65,0:01:24.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:39.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宿敌奈落从我们的面前消失得无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:41.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50年前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.88,0:01:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛这个强盗促成了奈落的诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.89,0:01:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而与鬼蜘蛛曾经结盟的罗刹鬼勘助
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:51.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,临死之前又碰见了桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同一个时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一路打探奈落的行踪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也碰到了一个意外
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:05.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第88话 猿神大爷的三个小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.01,0:02:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子的气氛好祥和哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子还没有被奈落糟蹋过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我总觉得这一带…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得什么 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.19,0:02:22.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么每块田都乱七八糟的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:23.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.53,0:02:25.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会是野猪出来捣乱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是好像又不太像…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:28.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得有点怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:29.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:31.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:32.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别走 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村里的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:34.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个银头发的年轻人请等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:35.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你头上长了一对耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:37.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然不是人类吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:40.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是在说犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:46.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你救救我们吧 犬神大爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:49.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然叫你犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:51.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:52.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.99,0:02:54.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么犬神？在说我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:05.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:05.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腌菜？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.07,0:03:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷大驾光临
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点微薄的小菜不成敬意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:15.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在整个村里 只剩下这点东西可以吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了犬神大爷之外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:19.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想不出还有谁可以救我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.58,0:03:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快用力扇 用力扇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然以为犬夜叉可以救他们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看恐怕拜错神了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:27.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这话什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个村子被那些猴子搞得一蹋糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.99,0:03:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害得大家都没饭吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:32.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:32.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从前的人不是说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:35.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猴子最怕的就是狗了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:38.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何 犬神大爷一定要救救我们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:40.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要帮我们赶走那些猴子…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:44.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 这个忙我们帮定了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.27,0:03:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 我哪里是什么犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶跑几只猴子一点都不难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我们哪有那么多鬼时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:53.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.65,0:03:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟珊瑚会趁这个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处打探奈落的行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.45,0:03:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:01.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 这里的村民那么可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会见死不救吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:09.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直是跟我开玩笑嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.03,0:04:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓猴子关我什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那有什么办法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你是犬神大爷嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:17.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是犬神大爷嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不怕死的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:25.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猴怪出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:27.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只狗妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明知道我们最恨的就是狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏替村民出头修理我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要让你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.62,0:04:36.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是这样 这场戏还有什么看头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:40.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢的就是对付妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:49.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是小猴子哎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.34,0:04:50.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.01,0:04:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 村子里的作物是你们糟蹋的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:00.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事是我们不对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了保证以后我们不会再犯错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:06.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把这个精灵石交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:09.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 居然低声下气主动认错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:11.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再不收就不够意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.73,0:05:12.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么？七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:16.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我劝你最好别太大意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们小妖最喜欢给别人东西然后再从中陷害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好还是别收下比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:23.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛不早点说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:30.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活该上当
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:33.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只狗妖怪 这下动不了了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有见过猴子红红的屁股啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是笨蛋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶作剧该有个限度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 你再厉害也没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.89,0:05:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你解得开我们的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不然别想甩掉那块大石头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:53.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？我倒要试试…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要让你们尝尝苦头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下知道厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:16.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去追他们 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你先在这边等我们一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:24.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是让他们跑掉了就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像刚刚他们说的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有施咒的人才解得开咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:31.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 弥勒法师我问你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是答应犬夜叉 要到处打探奈落的消息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:40.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在既没有鼻子超灵的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:43.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉得到四魂之玉碎片的戈薇也不在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:45.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说要怎么找呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才要不是那么说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:51.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想犬夜叉会乖乖帮那些村民吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要振作起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:01.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁怕你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.65,0:07:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们 合体…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:40.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陀螺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.18,0:07:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,栗子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,承让了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 大家快点过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:03.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要不要吃点心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:13.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么要糟蹋农夫伯伯的田地呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是在糟蹋那些田地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.11,0:08:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是在找被人类抓走的猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷本来是庙里供奉的神明
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.59,0:08:27.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是猿神大爷身边的小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:29.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直帮大神看着寺庙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便在那边修行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来因为战争
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寺庙被烧光了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:36.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷附身在里面的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:39.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道为什么会被人家偷走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们认为猿神大爷的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这个村子里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:45.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.74,0:08:47.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们猜想猿神大爷的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.41,0:08:50.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被埋在田地里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:51.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:54.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为猿神大爷曾经托梦给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:56.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也梦见过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:57.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有 我也梦过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:09:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷说 他被埋在一个又暗又湿的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:04.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大爷告诉我那个地方 小得他都快喘不过气了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷也跟我说 他很怕闻到那些蔬菜的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么东西在靠近我们耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:20.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样子好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐不骂你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:24.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们先帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先解开犬夜叉身上的咒语好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这恐怕不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经把咒语忘光了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:36.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么跟什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们再捣蛋下去 小心会挨揍受伤哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这家伙不管是大人小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:44.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要惹毛他都照打不误 知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:45.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是故意捣蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.03,0:09:48.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的忘得一干二净了 什么都记不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了你们 等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:09:59.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要找到猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.45,0:10:00.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咒语自然就解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:01.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这些咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来就是猿神大爷他教我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看还是尽快先回村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想办法找到神体再说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:10.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先走咯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.99,0:10:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好乖乖待在这边别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:15.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.73,0:10:17.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你累不累啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我老待在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不像样啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:27.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你变成什么样子了 臭笨狗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们…你们两个臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:35.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你这副德行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:37.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把铁碎牙也耍不动了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留给你太可惜了 别碰我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.39,0:10:42.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后我会帮你照顾戈薇的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:49.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙就由我做哥哥的替你保管吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:53.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 别走啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.41,0:11:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不需要等到你们来帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要找猿神大爷的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:05.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就在村子里才对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定在村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快还给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真没听过啊 什么神体的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么快就赶到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:14.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好不要再跟我们装傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.06,0:11:17.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找不到猿神大爷我们会没命的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点还给我们 还给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:25.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是想怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.80,0:11:27.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不把大石头替我拿掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:28.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会宰了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:31.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你动作还真快耶 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:32.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别靠那么近好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.37,0:11:34.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在还想不出移开石头的咒语吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.78,0:11:39.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全想不出来…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:44.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几只小猴子就可以用法术把你困在石头上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的是犬神大爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我早说了 是你们自己把我当成神的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实 他离犬神大爷还差得远呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:56.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说只有猿神大爷才知道解咒的方法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:57.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你们继续隐瞒下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.57,0:12:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子早晚会完蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.61,0:12:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我安静一点不要说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看大家分头去找找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:14.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续闹下去大家都会受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.45,0:12:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是很不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:17.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 有什么线索吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.99,0:12:21.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多是像这么大的一块神圣的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面刻着猿神大爷的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还圆滚滚的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.19,0:12:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:30.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后山山腰有一块像这样的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:30.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在后山
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:31.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在后山
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在后山
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:34.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了 就在后山是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:39.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:39.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:41.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:50.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得在河边见过像这样的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:50.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在河边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:51.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在河边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.49,0:12:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在河边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这块石头一点都不神圣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:12:59.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次又不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会在土地公那个林子里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.30,0:13:08.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会是在东边地藏王旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:12.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看应该在南方山谷才对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们家屋檐下好像有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:29.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个马上给我去找猿神大爷的神体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:42.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开的期间就发生了这样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.33,0:13:44.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是伤脑筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:48.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试试用我的法力看能不能帮上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.11,0:13:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的可以帮我们找回猿神大爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.94,0:13:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我的法力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.21,0:13:57.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要在早上才能发挥作用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:13:58.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系没关系…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:13:59.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:02.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想晚上找个地方好好睡一觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.89,0:14:04.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下命捡回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们全都上当啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:07.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚跟他们胡说八道的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候就一定可以想到办法啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:13.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得还是不太安心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:17.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也真是没用哎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:19.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被这种法术困得动弹不得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.87,0:14:20.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:21.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.87,0:14:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕在这样下去会不可收拾了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会不可收拾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这么下去 这只手就一直摆脱不了这颗石头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.25,0:14:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后没有办法再拿铁碎牙了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果犬夜叉就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:35.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直摆脱不了这颗石头…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.26,0:14:39.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:41.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快让开 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂…“岩”爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑什么啊你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:59.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这样也不错啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.41,0:15:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你又多了一项绝招了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.11,0:15:04.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个臭家伙 又在那边乱想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:07.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果犬夜叉一直摆脱不了石头…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:10.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:14.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有办法再等了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:16.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可以说走就走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.03,0:15:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:26.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死丫头 你也想到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:27.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我试着用风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.94,0:15:32.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吸走这块大石头的话 你说可行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以只吸这块大石头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要力道控制得当
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:37.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定真的可以喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试试打开风穴 来吸走这块大石头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:43.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你靠过来的时候风穴就…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在叫什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.56,0:15:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你有一半的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.43,0:15:53.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:56.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你在打什么鬼主意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:58.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:15:59.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:00.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次一定没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.47,0:16:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定不会把你吸进来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.01,0:16:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快停手啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:17.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你先进屋子算了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用特地留下来陪我也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:22.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你一个人待在这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会很寂寞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会寂寞啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫌我烦那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:28.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有嫌你烦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:30.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:31.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:34.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事还真是伤脑筋耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道有没有别的办法…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:43.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:45.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.62,0:16:48.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小地方就只有这种东西招待大家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在不成敬意…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腌菜怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.19,0:16:54.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是光芒是神光吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.09,0:16:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:17:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些菜是从这边的菜园采的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.67,0:17:03.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定是猿神大爷发出来的神光
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷托梦告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他住在一个又暗又湿的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地方很小喘不过气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个有臭菜味的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.15,0:17:16.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子果然是埋在田里没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:20.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是被埋在很深很深的土里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:20.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上把整个村子翻过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:26.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会又要作出那种事吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有样东西想要请你让我看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这块腌菜用的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:38.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还闪闪发亮的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:41.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不就是神体吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.61,0:17:42.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.11,0:17:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪闪发亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.77,0:17:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我怎么看不出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:48.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然作出这么该死的事情来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:49.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来猿神大爷真的是你们偷走的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石头是我们在村外捡到的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.52,0:17:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想拿来压腌菜缸刚好合用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:18:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是指在森林之外的地方捡到的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷一直好好的待在森林里面的寺庙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几个小精灵看守得可仔细了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 就连发生火灾那一次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是想尽办法 誓死保护猿神大爷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.41,0:18:18.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把猿神大爷抬到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.98,0:18:20.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样总该安全了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:23.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 有松果耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且有好多耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 这边也有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.73,0:18:38.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.76,0:18:39.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.30,0:18:41.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换句话说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们自己把这件事情给忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:47.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先用净水清洗一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:57.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等你们好久啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:18:59.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于又见到您老人家了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.05,0:19:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些蔬菜臭死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个小家伙有没有不乖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.83,0:19:13.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我们全都很乖…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:14.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.07,0:19:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心把犬夜叉给忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:24.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷要大家再帮他盖座新庙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.61,0:19:25.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,定时祭拜他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:28.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他就会保佑全村的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:36.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于摆脱那块石头了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无缘无故又在路上耽搁了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘你真聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:44.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然一下子就猜中我在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:45.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好的答谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您给我提示那么明显 很容易就发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个根本就是笨过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:54.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是口口声声说一定在田里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:56.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要大家赶快去挖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:57.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:20:00.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你们最好赶快离开这吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到外边有点不寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:04.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不寻常？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被放进腌菜缸之后不久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然感觉到一股从没有遇到过的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.09,0:20:13.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股可怕的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就从村子的上空飘过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:19.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猿神大爷后来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.37,0:20:24.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什么样的妖气 我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:28.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在缸里还追踪过它呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:28.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:30.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股妖气跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.01,0:20:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来就不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股妖气并没有走得太远
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.35,0:20:39.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是很快地突然就不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:40.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.36,0:20:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有错 那一定是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖气是往丑寅方向移动的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:48.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丑寅方向…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就是东北方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:51.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.53,0:20:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就一点都感觉不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:56.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:21:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经可以决定接下来该往哪边去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:20.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是松果吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些死小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.67,0:21:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓到你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次报仇了 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:30.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次也报仇了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几个小家伙 还挺好玩的不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.76,0:21:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是还没有断奶的小猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:21:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:03.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:05.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好烦哦 走快点行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标是丑寅方向
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:19.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:29.17,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.95,0:22:38.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:48.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.74,0:22:52.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.27,0:22:57.61,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:23:06.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.19,0:23:11.49,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.83,0:23:16.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.50,0:23:24.17,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.57,0:23:34.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:48.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说戈薇病倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.57,0:23:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近大家忙着寻找奈落把她给累坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.07,0:23:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说不但感冒而且还发烧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.34,0:23:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才急急忙忙的赶回家
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.81,0:23:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该要不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.58,0:23:57.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们那边医药那么发达
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.81,0:23:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想没问题 应该很快就会好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.21,0:24:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.31,0:24:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像又偷偷去找戈薇了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去探病是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都看不出犬夜叉这小子这么体贴
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.29,0:24:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.68,0:24:10.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和他之间的探病大战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.82,0:24:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和他？到底谁跟谁啊
